{"turn_id": "d18-t1", "session_id": "d18", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "training_corpora", "text": "The model is trained on corpora consisting of historical documents paired with modern versions: the Dutch Bible (1637 version as original and 1888 version as modern Dutch) and El Quijote (17th century Spanish novel with its 21st century version).", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "el_conde_lucanor_test_only", "text": "El Conde Lucanor (14th century Spanish novel with its 21st century version) was used only as a test due to its small corpus size; because no suitable training corpus was found, the systems built for El Quijote were used to modernize it.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "small_training_corpora", "text": "The training corpora were small in size, which the authors note is likely why SMT outperformed NMT, a well-known problem in NMT.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"}]}, {"key": "future_enrich_training_corpus", "text": "As future work, the authors want to explore techniques for enriching the training corpus with additional data.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-e242628d1556d3af58dbaeaa"}]}, {"key": "byte_pair_encoding", "text": "Joint byte pair encoding was applied to all corpora using 32,000 merge operations.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-c6a05839a9508ca94a3810f0"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d18-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d18-t2", "session_id": "d18", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "dutch_bible_corpus", "text": "荷兰圣经语料包含1637、1657、1888和2010四个版本；由于作者提到2010版翻译不太可靠，且荷兰语在1637至1657年间变化不大，实验只使用1637版作为原始文档、1888版作为现代荷兰语。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "el_quijote_corpus", "text": "El Quijote语料包含17世纪塞万提斯所著的西班牙语小说及其对应的21世纪版本，被选为第二个语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "el_conde_lucanor_test_only", "text": "El Conde Lucanor语料包含14世纪Don Juan Manuel的西班牙语小说原文及对应的21世纪版本；由于语料规模小，仅用作测试，并且由于找不到合适的训练语料，作者使用为El Quijote构建的系统来现代化El Conde Lucanor。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "small_training_corpora_effect", "text": "作者指出SMT在所有情况下都优于NMT，很可能是因为训练语料规模小——这是NMT的一个已知问题；同样，神经模型可能因训练语料小而未能达到最佳性能。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"}, {"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-8fc9d3b1c3927dbda3aee8ff"}]}, {"key": "future_enrich_corpus", "text": "作为未来工作，作者希望探索用额外数据丰富训练语料的技术，以及处理由子词导致的错误生成词问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-e242628d1556d3af58dbaeaa"}]}, {"key": "smnt_systems", "text": "作者基于SMT和NMT两种方法构建了基于前缀的IMT现代化协议，并在模拟环境中测试。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-e242628d1556d3af58dbaeaa"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d18-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
